who survived the battle for home tree is  Jake now the leader of the navi people  we break down the ending of Avatar  before the way of water premieres Avatar  takes place in 2154 humans have depleted  the Earth's natural resources and moved  on to outer space colonizing worlds like  Pandora a moon orbiting a gas giant in  the Alpha Centauri Galaxy the main  character is Jake Sully a paraplegic  former Marine his identical twin brother  was part of a team of scientists on  Pandora who are researching the planet  and its indigenous inhabitants the navi  using human Navi hybrids called avatars  humans can walk among the navi  communicate with them and learn their  ways Jake joins Dr Grace Augustine  scientist Norm Spellman and Marine pilot  Trudy on their research mission of  course the resources development  Administration has more in mind as RDA  administrator Parker Selfridge points  out the real reason humans are on  Pandora is to mine a mineral called  unobtainium which sells for Millions on  Earth Colonel Miles quarrich offers make  a deal find out all he can about the  navi and he'll make sure Jake gets new  legs but Jake's infiltration into the  navi civilization doesn't go as he  expected he meets a navi woman named  natiri learns about the planet and the  navi spiritual connection to all living  things and becomes one of them Jake and  natiri fall in love and become life  mates Complicated by the fact that Jake  is still a human living vicariously  through his Navi Avatar and the fact  that he's technically a spy for the RDA  I trusted you you trust me now please  toward the end of Avatar the RDA orders  the destruction of Home tree natiri's  tribe's home base because of the rich  deposits of unobtainium that Lies  Beneath by this point Jake is fully on  team Navi even though natiri and other  members of her tribe have turned against  him after finding out about his spying  Jake has completely changed his identity  considering himself a part of the navi  embracing their beliefs and so he fights  for their cause against the RDA but  quarrette's huge military planes massive  guns and numerous soldiers quickly  overpower the tribe and Tom tree is  destroyed during the battle many lives  are lost including natiri's father a  toucan Jake Grace and Norm's human  bodies are rescued by Trudy who airlifts  them and their Avatar capsules to a safe  location while their Navi avatars are  left in the forest but during the Mayhem  quarridge shoots them with a bullet  hitting Grace to regain the trust of  natiri the Oma Takaya tribe and their  new Chief zute Jake mounts and bonds  with taruk a huge dragon-like Beast  related to the smaller banshees by  bonding with this Fierce Beast who the  navi both Revere and fear Jake proves  that he's a part of the navi that he  respects their culture and he wants to  live among them Jake is embraced by  natiri her mother moat and zute and  together they make plans to gather the  numerous Navi tribes to fight back  against the RDA and evict them from  Pandora before Jake sets out to unite  the navi Clans he has one request of  moat save Grace still suffering from her  gunshot wound Grace's life is in the  Navy's hands as is the life of her  Avatar as natiri explains all life on  Pandora is connected via a biological  neural network though the navi consider  it more of a spiritual connection than a  scientific one the tree of voices allows  a living Navi to hear the memories of  their ancestors while the Tree of Souls  is said to be the closest connection to  AWA the guiding force of Pandora that  the navi worship as a deity the Tree of  Souls natiri explains has such power  that it can transfer her Consciousness  through the immersive neural network of  Pandora and have her permanently placed  into her Avatar body so she can survive  this transformation doesn't just tie  like the Navy's spiritual beliefs but  also hints at the potential scientific  advancements that could be achieved in  the future Grace's body is weak and she  doesn't survive the process but before  she dies she assures Jake that she sees  AWA the connections are real and the  world of Pandora is truly a living thing  [Music]  she's real  the final battle for Pandora includes  the RDA Soldiers the many tribes of  Pandora and one final participant AWA  herself or at least AWA manifested  through the animals and wildlife of  Pandora who came to the Navy's defense  at the last minute the night before the  battle Jake connects neurologically to  the Tree of Souls and asks that AWA  helped them on their quest to defeat the  RDA this more than his bond with taruk  proves Jake has fully embraced his life  as a navi he used taruk to regain natiri  and the other Navy's trust but his  prayer to AWA is a private act showing  us that he now believes in the power of  Pandora and its spiritual Network during  the battle at a moment when it looks  like the navi might be defeated once  again suddenly a great Rumble is heard  from Beyond the Forest numerous animals  from throughout the planet join the  fight understanding that the RDA is  destroying their world and their  survival depends on their involvement  not only is the neural connection on  Pandora more significant than previously  thought but the creatures of the planet  are capable of more complex decisions  it was heard you the animals joining the  fight eventually lead to the rda's  defeat and the return of Pandora to its  original inhabitants after the battle  many of the humans left on Pandora are  forced to head back to Earth Jake of  course wants to stay but he can't do so  well still in his human body the love  between Jake and natiri is strong but  with humans unable to breathe Pandora's  air maintaining their relationship would  be rather difficult not to mention the  fact that Jake doesn't even consider  himself human anymore he spent so much  time as one of the navi learning and  embracing their way of life that  remaining human would just be a letdown  so Jake asks the navi to connect his  human body as well as his Navi Avatar to  the Tree of Souls via their neural  networks the navi pray together chant  and ask that Ewa transfer Jake from his  human form into his Avatar the closing  shot of the film is Jake's Avatar  opening his eyes urgently suggesting  that the process did indeed work and  that Jake can now go on living as a true  Navi Sigourney Weaver's Dr Grace  Augustine doesn't survive the Battle of  Home tree and she was far from the only  casualty during the Epic final Conflict  Trudy switches sides as well outfitting  her fighter plane and face with Navi  colors but her plane gets shot down  omatakai achieved sute is also mortally  wounded in the battle and after the  battle ends asks Jake to end his  suffering at first Jake is reluctant to  do so but as sute explains it is a great  honor and passes the tribe leadership  onto Jake before Jake ends his suffering  on the human front scientist Norm  Spellman survives the battle  unfortunately his Navi Avatar gets shot  and dies so Norm has to remain in his  human form on Pandora from then on Norm  is one of the few humans who is  permitted to stay and he fronts a new  and ongoing scientific exploration team  one that has nothing to do with  procuring unobtainium or Conquering the  indigenous peoples of the planet  natiri's mother moat also survives the  final battle and it's she who supervises  the ritual at the Tree of Souls to  transfer Jake's Consciousness from his  human body to his Navi Avatar greedy RDA  administrator Parker Selfridge was only  out for one thing the money and power  that came with dominating the navi and  destroying their land as a character  Selfridge was the movie's embodiment of  colonialist and imperialist capitalist  interests his descriptions of the navi  as quote fly bitten Savages that live in  trees could mirror any of History's  conquering forces as they dominated the  indigenous peoples in various countries  across the world thankfully Selfridge is  banished from Pandora by the end of the  film though it isn't known whether he's  learned any kind of lesson a much more  gruesome fate befalls Colonel Miles  quarridge who throughout the movie  becomes a more Sinister violent and  frightening villain than Selfridge  during the final battle quarridge heads  to the Hallelujah mountains where Jake's  human body is connected to his Navi  Avatar through the Pod quarrych tries to  disconnect and kill Jake but his mission  is interrupted by natiri writing her new  Santa tour a fierce land mammal of  Pandora that looks like a cross between  a cat and a dinosaur just as quarrette  is about to crush Jake with the use of  his amp suit natiri launches two giant  arrows into his chest it's after  quarrych's death that natiri meets  Jake's human form for the first time  lovingly greeting each other with the  traditional Navi saying I see you  I see you  Avatar was so successful and James  Cameron became so immersed in its World  building that it's no surprise there are  plans for a whopping four additional  movies but with or without all of the  upcoming sequels James Cameron's Avatar  was a truly Innovative and interesting  film one that plunged audiences deep  into a new world and heralded a new era  of filmmaking the motion capture  technology as well as the use of 3D  definitely had an impact on the film  industry although 3D as a gimmick is  dying down a bit these days motion  capture as well as new advances in  computer graphics and life-like  animation are more integral to  filmmakers than ever it's those  technological advancements that will be  the lasting Legacy of Avatar as well as  Cameron's ability to bring action and  heart to some of his most elaborate  worlds regardless of how the sequels  fare the original ushered us into the  New Millennium of cinematic experiences  so it's exciting to imagine what's  coming next from Cameron and Pandora  when the second avatar movie The Way of  water debuts in December 2022  foreign
 

